摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Build verified extensions for DeepSeek Harness with an installable agent skill.","id":"gh:1334576392","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-creator","slug":"KiWi233333/dsh-creator","topics":["agent-skills","claude-code","codex","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","mcp"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Build verified extensions for DeepSeek Harness with an installable agent skill."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH Creator"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"An agent skill for building plugins, tools, adapters, hooks, skills, MCP connections, UI nodes, prot"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ocol drivers, and configuration for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Install with the open agent skills CLI:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"List the repository's skills without installing:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness discovers project skills from `.dsh/skills/` and `.agents/skills/`, and user skills"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" from `~/.dsh/skills/` and `~/.agents/skills/`. See Compatibility for the currently verified DSH rel"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" `~/.dsh/skills/` and `~/.agents/skills/`. See Compatibility for the currently verified DSH release."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## What it covers"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Area | The skill helps you |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Plugin bundles | Package and install reusable Cordis plugins into DSH profiles |\n| Tools | Define "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"typed model-facing tools, outputs, presentation, and policies |\n| LLM adapters | Implement provider "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"translation and the `StreamChunk` protocol |\n| Hooks | Build native lifecycle hooks or configure Cla"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"ude Code/Codex bridges |\n| Skills | Author portable `SKILL.md` bundles and choose discovery scope |\n"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"| MCP | Configure the built-in MCP client for stdio or Streamable HTTP servers |\n| UI nodes | Add re"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"play-safe conversation nodes to the Web client |\n| Protocols | Drive DSH through its TypeScript SDK "},{"id":"p13s7","text":"or ACP surface |\n| Configuration | Compose profiles, bundles, home patches, and CLI overlays |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The main skill stays concise and routes the agent to one focused reference at a time. Templates are "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"starter implementations, while runtime contracts remain anchored to the official DSH source and docu"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"plementations, while runtime contracts remain anchored to the official DSH source and documentation."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Example prompts"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Compatibility and status"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"DSH is currently a developer preview and may introduce breaking changes. This project records a test"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ed DSH baseline separately from its own release version so compatibility can advance without conflat"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ing the two projects' histories. See COMPATIBILITY.md."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"DSH Creator is an independent community project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Issues and focused pull requests are welcome. Read CONTRIBUTING.md and run `node scripts/validate.mj"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"s` before submitting changes."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Attribution and license"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The DSH Creator mark is a modified community artwork based on the DeepSeek Harness favicon. Source a"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"nd license details are preserved in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"DSH Creator is released under the MIT License."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
